createdby: DBot
description: 'Creates or modifies the PublicAccessBlock configuration for an Amazon
  S3 bucket in a specified AWS account and region. Controls whether public access
  is allowed through ACLs and bucket policies. Use this action to remediate cloud
  posture issues by enabling all four public access block settings (BlockPublicAcls,
  IgnorePublicAcls, BlockPublicPolicy, RestrictPublicBuckets) to prevent any public
  access to the bucket and its objects. This is a remediation action that modifies
  bucket configuration. REQUIRES: `account_id`, `region`, and the resource identifier.
  When these are not present in user input, resolve them first via `CortexListAssets`
  using the issue''s asset_id or asset_name.'
